{
 "sheet": 1,
 "name": "ADM1491EBRZ-REEL7",
 "kind": "interface",
 "manufacturer": "Analog Devices",
 "title": "ADM1490E/ADM1491E: 16 Mbps full-duplex RS-485/RS-422 transceivers with ±8 kV ESD protection",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev. B, 7/09",
  "pages": 16
 },
 "summary": "A 5 V full-duplex RS-485/RS-422 transceiver, one driver and one receiver on separate pin pairs, rated to 16 Mbps and aimed at motor-control links. The bus pins survive ±8 kV HBM, the receiver is one unit load (32 nodes) with an open-input fail-safe high, and the driver has current limiting and thermal shutdown. The ADM1490E (8-lead SOIC or MSOP) has no enables; the ADM1491E (14-lead SOIC or 10-lead MSOP) adds DE and RE. ADM1491EBRZ-REEL7 is the ADM1491E in the 14-lead SOIC.",
